<http://data.silknow.org/event/6578c622-5918-3f64-8f63-6fad99f7a843>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "A modern label attached to one of the silhouettes which were acquired as part of this bequest reads :\n\nACKWORTH DARNING was worked by Eliza Broadhead when aged 10. She was AMLB's great great aunt married to David Coope.\n\nThe three related silhouettes are E.176 to 178-1998.\nA second sampler from the bequest is T.732-1997."@en ;
        ecrm:P14_carried_out_by        <http://data.silknow.org/actor/8e4ce1b8-4498-3eb2-9f03-2506077772f1> ;
