        ecrm:P23_transferred_title_from
                "Bequeathed by Alison Brown" ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/c56eb759-7aa3-3512-a5ae-a899b5ddd3fd> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "A modern label attached to one of the silhouettes which were acquired as part of this bequest reads :\n\nACKWORTH DARNING was worked by Eliza Broadhead when aged 10. She was AMLB's great great aunt married to David Coope.\n\nThe three related silhouettes are E.176 to 178-1998.\nA second sampler from the bequest is T.732-1997."@en .
